utations","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"RU","title":"Ад в Лягушачьем городе","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"ES","title":"Un semental en Frogtown","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"ES","title":"Un semental en Frogtown (El Infierno vuelve a Frogtown)","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"ES","title":"El infierno vuelve a Frogtown","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"BR","title":"A Continuação da Espécie","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"DE","title":"The Hunter - Hell Comes to Frogtown","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"BR","title":"Hell Vai Até Frogtown","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"BR","title":"O Inferno Chega a Frogtown","type":""}],"externalIds":{"imdb_id":"tt0093171","wikidata_id":"Q1769344","facebook_id":null,"instagram_id":null,"twitter_id":null},"keywords":[{"id":2964,"name":"future"},{"id":2766,"name":"mutation"},{"id":1852,"name":"mutant"},{"id":4458,"name":"post-apocalyptic future"},{"id":9044,"name":"amphibie"},{"id":12332,"name":"apocalypse"},{"id":164218,"name":"psychotronic"},{"id":309974,"name":"absurd"}],"releaseDates":[{"iso_3166_1":"CA","release_dates":[{"certification":"R","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"1988-01-29T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]},{"iso_3166_1":"DE","release_dates":[{"certification":"16","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"1988-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]},{"iso_3166_1":"GB","release_dates":[{"certification":"15","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"1988-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":3},{"certification":"15","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"en","note":"Blu-ray","release_date":"2016-12-19T00:00:00.000Z","type":5}]},{"iso_3166_1":"US","release_dates":[{"certification":"R","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"Source: https://rateyourmusic.com/film/hell_comes_to_frogtown/","release_date":"1988-01-29T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]}],"translations":[{"iso_639_1":"en","iso_3166_1":"US","name":"English","english_name":"English","title":"","overview":"'Hell' is the name of the hero of the story. He's a prisoner of the women who now run the USA after a nuclear/biological war. Results of the war are that mutants have evolved, and the human race is in danger of extinction due to infertility. Hell is given the task of helping in the rescue of a group of fertile women from the harem of the mutant leader (resembling a frog). Hell cannot escape since he has a bomb attached to his private parts which will detonate if he strays more than a few hundred yards from his guard.","tagline":"A new breed of enemy has taken over the world... Sam Hell has come to take it back."},{"iso_639_1":"it","iso_3166_1":"IT","name":"Italiano","english_name":"Italian","title":"Apocalisse a Frogtown - La città delle rane","overview":"Dieci anni sono trascorsi da quando, alla fine del XX secolo, il Big One, una guerra nucleare e batteriologica ha decimato l'umanità. Radiazioni e virus hanno provocato effetti devastanti, rendendo sterili la maggior parte degli uomini e dando vita ad una orrida razza di umanoidi mutanti, ibridi di rane. In questo scenario si muove Sam Hellman (Piper), soprannominato \"Hell\", uno dei rarissimi maschi ancora fertili, che dispensa la sua virilità tra la popolazione femminile superstite. Per sfuggire al capitano Devlin che non ha gradito di vedere la propria figlia aggiungersi alla lunga lista delle sue \"vittime\", Hell non ha altra scelta che arruolarsi nella Medtech, organismo creato dal governo per il ripopolamento della specie umana.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"DE","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"The Hunter - Ein erbarmungsloser Jäger","overview":"Die Welt ist zerstört, die meisten Männer können keine Kinder zeugen. Eine der wenigen Ausnahmen ist Hell, der einen Deal mit der Regierung eingeht, so viele Frauen wie möglich zu schwängern. Einige fruchtbare Frauen werden in Frogtown gefangen gehalten, einer Stadt in der Mutanten leben, deren Gene sich aus Frosch und Mensch gemischt haben.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"fr","iso_3166_1":"FR","name":"Français","english_name":"French","title":"Transmutations","overview":"Le récent holocauste nucléaire a terriblement réduit la population mâle et rendu la majorité des terriens stériles. Sam Hell, accompagné de la belle et courageuse Spangle se rend dans une région encore ravagée par le cataclysme et apprend que le commandant Toty, le grand chef des mutants de Frogtown a enlevé 8 femmes humaines pour son harem...","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"he","iso_3166_1":"IL","name":"עִבְרִית","english_name":"Hebrew","title":"גהנום בעיר הצפרדעים","overview":"הל הוא שמו של גיבור הסרט הלוקח חלק בארה\"ב הנשלטת ע\"י נשים בעקבות מלחמה שהסתיימה. תוצאות המלחמה הביאו עימם מוטציות המעמידות את המין האנושי בסכנת הכחדה. הל נאלץ לחלץ קבוצה של נשים אשר מוזחקות בשבי.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ru","iso_3166_1":"RU","name":"Pусский","english_name":"Russian","title":"Переполох в городе жаб","overview":"Родди Пайпер играет Сэма Хелла, атлета, мощь которого удачно дополняется его хладнокровием и сообразительностью. Сэм пробирается в Лягушачий город, индустриальный кошмар, кишащий мутантами.  Единственный шанс уцелеть — это сразить Тоти, верховного мутанта, сеющего смерть. Бешеная охота начинается…","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"ES","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","title":"El infierno vuelve a Frogtown","overview":"Tras la Guerra Nuclear y el holocausto que le siguió, la Tierra se ha visto dominada por ranas mutantes gigantes. El duro superviviente Sam Hell es uno de los pocos hombres fértiles que aún quedan en el planeta, y en pos de preservar la especie, debe encontrar a alguna mujer fértil para inseminarla. Cuenta con tres secuelas: Return to Frogtown (1993), Toad Warrior (1996), y Max Hell Frog Warrior (2002). (FILMAFFINITY)","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"nl","iso_3166_1":"NL","name":"Nederlands","english_name":"Dutch","title":"","overview":"De gevangene Hell is op de vlucht voor de vrouwen die momenteel regeren over de Verenigde Staten en komt in het stadje Frogtown terecht. De inwoners van Frogtown hebben enorm te lijden gehad onder de gevolgen van de atoomoorlog en zijn gemuteerd tot kikker-achtige wezens. Hell krijgt de opdracht om een groep vruchtbare vrouwen uit de klauwen van de kikkermonsters te bevrijden.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"el","iso_3166_1":"GR","name":"ελληνικά","english_name":"Greek","title":"","overview":"Μετά από το πυρηνικό ολοκαύτωμα οι γυναίκες διοικούν ένα πλανήτη στον οποίο οι άνδρες που μπορούν να γονιμοποιήσουν μια γυναίκα μετρώνται στα δάχτυλα του ενός χεριού. Ένας τέτοιος είναι ο Sam Hell, ο οποίος πρώτα πρέπει να σώσει μια ομάδα γυναικών από την Πόλη των Βατράχων που κατοικείται από επιθετικά βατραχόμορφα μεταλλαγμένα όντα.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"CN","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"勇闯青蛙城","overview":"黑尔是故事主人公的名字。在核战争爆发后，人类是面临灭绝的危险而致不孕。黑尔接受了救助在突变体首领后宫里育龄妇女的任务。他无法逃脱，因为他的私处连接了一个炸弹。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pl","iso_3166_1":"PL","name":"Polski","english_name":"Polish","title":"Miasto żab","overview":"Odległa przyszłość. Świat po katastrofie nuklearnej. Upadek cywilizacji, bezpłodność, mutanci. Spangle i Sam Hell wędrują przez opustoszałe krainy z niezwykłą misją. Na ich drodze stają zdegenerowani mieszkańcy Miasta Żab. Dochodzi do dramatycznej rozgrywki...","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pt","iso_3166_1":"BR","name":"Português","english_name":"Portuguese","title":"O Inferno Chega a Frogtown","overview":"'Hell' é o nome do herói deste filme, ele é um prisioneiro de mulheres que trabalham nos EUA após uma guerra nuclear biológica. Os resultados da guerra são que as mulheres se tornaram mutantes evoluídas, deixando a raça humana sob perigo de extinção, devido à infertilidade. Hell é convocado a tarefa de ajudar um grupo de mulheres férteis do Harém (que se assemelha a uma rã) para salva-las.","tagline":"Um novo tipo de inimigo tomou conta do mundo... Sam Hell veio para recuperá-lo."},{"iso_639_1":"da","iso_3166_1":"DK","name":"Dansk","english_name":"Danish","title":"Helt på spanden i fremtiden","overview":"Efter at atomvåben og biologisk krigsførelse har ryddet godt og grundigt op i menneskeheden, har kvinderne taget over og styrer en verden, fyldt med mutanter og sterile mænd. Filmens helt, kaldet ”Hell”, får til opgave at befri en gruppe frugtbare kvinder fra mutantlederens harem, og det er en opgave, han tager seriøst, da han har fået bundet en bombe om kønsdelene, der vil eksplodere, dersom han bevæger sig blot en smule væk fra sin vagt.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ko","iso_3166_1":"KR","name":"한국어/조선말","english_name":"Korean","title":"헬 컴즈 투 프로그타운","overview":"","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"cs","iso_3166_1":"CZ","name":"Český","english_name":"Czech","title":"Žabí teror","overview":"Světovou nukleární pohromu přežije příliš málo lidí na to, aby člověku nehrozila úplná zkáza. Uchránit je třeba především ženy, aby uchovaly rod. To je úkol pro Sama Hella, muže železných svalů a smrtelně rychlého úsudku. Jak ale vyrvat kořist zákeřným mutantům, obývajícím Žabí zemi?","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"hu","iso_3166_1":"HU","name":"Magyar","english_name":"Hungarian","title":"Békaváros","overview":"A Rocket Rangers csapatának életük legnehezebb feladatát kell végrehajtania: le kell győzniük a mutáns békák királyát, a Főbéka Cárt, hogy megmentsék az emberiséget a mutáns lényektől.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"HK","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"勇闖青蛙城","overview":"黑爾是故事主人公的名字。在核戰爭爆發後，人類是面臨滅絕的危險而致不孕。黑爾接受了救助在突變體首領後宮裏育齡婦女的任務。他無法逃脱，因為他的私處連接了一個炸彈。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ar","iso_3166_1":"SA","name":"العربية","english_name":"Arabic","title":"","overview":"في مستقبل ما بعد الحرب النووية، يُكلف رجل نادر الخصوبة بمهمة إنقاذ نساء من مخلوقات مطفرة شرسة، فيبدأ رحلة مجنونة وخطيرة.","tagline":""}],"videos":[{"key":"JP61cnrEjPo","site":"YouTube","type":"Featurette","name":"The only fertile man left alive and his job is to repopulate the Earth!","iso_639_1":"en","official":true,"published_at":"2026-09-17T17:00:00.000Z","size":108